Commit:     lkjsxc <lkjsxc@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Mon Nov 16 17:57:08 2026 +0000

    Skip export-only reference recording in ordinary compilation
    
    Select full source-reference capture before inference and preserve the mode
    through verification, demand, fallback and ordinary checkpoint resumption.
    Guard the two export-only vectors without suppressing lexical origins,
    constraints or checked IR. Refuse late full export before publishing a catalog.
    
    Apply all 585 retained language lines through 24 audited semantic operations.
    Retain every preliminary refusal and exact source/transaction evidence.
    The candidate is a 32,588,975-byte b01eabfa fixed point at producer inline64.
    
    Cold four-worker gate: 5,455 fresh case requests, zero skips, 728 structural
    contracts and 128 mutants/zero findings; 611.802 s, load 3.45 to 3.68.
    Bootstrap: 79.97 s, load 1.58 to 2.78.
    Focused query lifecycle: 8.33 s, load 2.42 to 5.64.
    No memory saving, 1M relief or generated-code milestone is claimed yet.

